---
// Industries section
---
<section id="industries" style="padding: 128px 24px">
<div style="max-width: 1120px; margin: 0 auto; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 56px">
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(min(100%, 280px), 1fr)); gap: 32px 64px; align-items: start">
<div style="display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 10px; font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: 0.16em; color: #2DD4BF; font-weight: 700; padding-top: 14px"><span style="width: 6px; height: 6px; border-radius: 50%; background: #2DD4BF"></span>INDUSTRIES</div>
<div style="grid-column: span 2; min-width: 0; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 22px" class="editorial-main">
<h2 style="margin: 0; font-size: clamp(36px, 4.8vw, 60px); line-height: 1.06; letter-spacing: -0.02em; color: #5EEAD4; font-weight: 700">Trusted where the data<br>matters most.</h2>
<p style="margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.65; color: #E6EAF2; max-width: 680px">Our practitioners have built platforms inside health systems, pharmaceutical R&amp;D, state public health agencies and global agriscience.</p>
</div>
</div>
<div style="display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr)); gap: 1px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 14px; overflow: hidden">
<a href="/#contact" style="background: rgba(10,15,26,0.72); padding: 36px 32px; text-decoration: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 64" style="width: 120px; height: 64px; display: block" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><path d="M30 52 C10 38 6 26 14 18 c6-6 14-4 16 3 c2-7 10-9 16-3 c8 8 4 20-16 34 z" stroke-opacity="0.9"></path><path d="M2 34 H40 l6-12 l8 22 l6-10 H118" stroke-opacity="0.6"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF">Healthcare</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A9B3C6">EHR-derived data, PHI governance, clinical and operational analytics.</span><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #2DD4BF">Learn more →</span></a>
