<a href="/#contact" style="background: rgba(10,15,26,0.72); padding: 36px 32px; text-decoration: none; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px"><svg viewBox="0 0 120 64" style="width: 120px; height: 64px; display: block" aria-hidden="true" fill="none" stroke="#2DD4BF" stroke-width="1.8" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"><circle cx="32" cy="32" r="26" stroke-opacity="0.6"></circle><path d="M6 32 H58 M32 6 C20 20 20 44 32 58 M32 6 C44 20 44 44 32 58" stroke-opacity="0.4"></path><path d="M82 30 c0-8 6-14 12-14 s12 6 12 14 c0 10-12 22-12 22 s-12-12-12-22 z"></path><circle cx="94" cy="30" r="4"></circle><path d="M58 32 H74" stroke-dasharray="3 4" stroke-opacity="0.6"></path></svg><span style="font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; color: #FFFFFF">Public Health</span><span style="font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; color: #A9B3C6">Surveillance and reporting data, interagency sharing, secure analytics.</span><span style="font-size: 14px; font-weight: 700; color: #2DD4BF">Learn more →</span></a>
